  "design": "The two diagnostics run between native-before and native-after. Reverse the case order in even rounds and rotate by five positions in rounds three and four. Reverse diagnostic order when the canonical case index plus zero-based round is odd. For every child, open the immutable registered input afresh as a regular, read-only FD 0. Generate inputs once, hash and warm all files before the first sample, and hash again after the last. Use whole-child wait4 CPU.",
